---
title: New API reference, with a live try-it console
date: 2026-09-08
summary: /docs/api got a full redesign — searchable, grouped by feature, and every endpoint has a Try it panel that calls the real API.
type: changelog
tags:
  - api
  - developer-experience
draft: false
---

The API reference at [/docs/api](/docs/api) has a new look. It's searchable,
grouped by feature area in a proper sidebar, and every endpoint has a **Try
it** panel — fill in the parameters and see a real response, no separate
tool needed.

Old bookmarks to a specific endpoint's own page still work; they land you on
the main reference now instead of 404ing.

Nothing about the API itself changed — same endpoints, same behavior, just a
better way to read about them.
